# Tolerant fixture: quoted and normalized identifiers (CLIFF 1.1 Appendix C.2.4,
# C.2.5).
#
# `cliff-python` reads a quoted entry id as the bare id, and normalizes an
# identifier that contains a character outside the name set. Both are repairs:
# the strict grammar accepts neither a quoted id nor `Save & Load` as an id.
